.Dd 2026-05-30
.Dt NOMAD-STL 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm nomad-stl
.Nd manage the offline Workshop 3D-model library
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm nomad stl
.Op Cm list | scan | import Ar DIR Op Ar CATEGORY | path
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm nomad stl
works with the Workshop library, the on-disk collection of
.Pa .stl
and
.Pa .3mf
3D-printable models that the admin service indexes and serves offline.
The library lives under
.Pa $NOMAD_DATA_ROOT/storage/stl-library
on the data drive.
.Pp
With no subcommand,
.Cm list
runs and prints the indexed catalog from the admin service.
The
.Cm import
subcommand copies model files into the library from a directory on the host
and triggers a rescan so they appear in the index.
.Sh OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Cm list
Print the indexed Workshop catalog from the admin service.
This is the default when no subcommand is given.
.It Cm scan
Trigger an admin-side rescan of the library, the same code path as the
Rescan button in the Workshop UI.
.It Cm import Ar DIR Op Ar CATEGORY
Copy every
.Pa .stl
and
.Pa .3mf
file found under
.Ar DIR
into the library, then trigger a rescan.
Existing files of the same name are skipped rather than overwritten.
.Ar CATEGORY
is one of
.Cm medical ,
.Cm tools ,
.Cm household ,
.Cm replacement-parts ,
.Cm agriculture ,
.Cm firearm-accessories ,
or
.Cm other ;
it defaults to
.Cm other ,
and an unrecognized value falls back to
.Cm other
with a warning.
.It Cm path
Print the absolute path of the library root on the host.
.El
.Sh EXAMPLES
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Ic nomad stl list
Show the indexed models.
.It Ic nomad stl scan
Rescan the library directory and update the index.
.It Ic nomad stl import ~/Downloads/prints tools
Copy 3D-model files from a directory into the tools category and rescan.
.It Ic nomad stl path
Print the host path of the library root.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr nomad 1 ,
.Xr nomad-services 1
